  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">WWF evaluation 2016 - Decision co</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">WWF utv&#xe4;rdering 2016</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Sida avser att utv&#xe4;rdera hur WWF:s verksamhet har bidragit till CSO   -strategins &#xf6;vegripande m&#xe5;l under perioden 2013-2015, och hur         relevanta f&#xf6;r&#xe4;ndringar inom insatsen har bidragit till att            ytterligare uppfylla dessa. Speciellt huruvida kapacitetsutveckling   har bidragit till att st&#xe4;rka den tekniska, administrativa och         organisatoriska kapaciteten hos WWF:s programkontor och samarbetsorga</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sida is going to conduct an evaluation in order to verify how WWF:s   activities have contributed to achieve the overall objectives of the  CSO- Strategy during 2013-2015 and how relevant changes within the    program has contributed to achieve further results. In particular to  what extent capacity development has contributed to strengthen the    technical, admninistrative and organisational capacity among WWF/PO.</narrative>
  </description>
